GarageFlow 
Task 5: Data Constraints to maintain validity

This section defines the data constraints applied to each data entity established in Task 3 and 4 
to maintain the validity of the database 

PK: Primary Key
FK: Foreign Key

---

Structure of a Garage

garage
  • garage_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • name --> NOT NULL
  • total_capacity --> NOT NULL, CHECK (total_capacity > 0)
  • number_of_floors --> NOT NULL, CHECK (number_of_floors > 0)
  • operating_hours --> NOT NULL
  • front_desk_phone --> NULLABLE

floor
  • floor_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • garage_id --> FK, NOT NULL 
  • floor_number --> NOT NULL, CHECK (floor_number >= 0)
  • floor_name --> NULLABLE
  • total_spots --> NOT NULL, CHECK (total_spots > 0)
  • available_spots --> NOT NULL, (available_spots >= 0 AND available_spots <= total_spots)

parking_spot
  • spot_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • floor_id --> FK, NOT NULL, UNIQUE
  • spot_type --> NOT NULL (ENUM: standard, handicap, staff)
  • status --> NOT NULL (ENUM: available, occupied, out_of_order)
  • location_reference --> NULLABLE, UNIQUE

gate_event
  • gate_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • garage_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • gate_type --> NOT NULL (ENUM: entry, exit)
  • status --> NOT NULL (ENUM: open, closed, out_of_order)

---

Users

customer
  • customer_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • name --> NOT NULL
  • email --> NOT NULL, UNIQUE
  • phone_number --> NOT NULL, UNIQUE
  • date_created --> NOT NULL
  • account_status --> NOT NULL (ENUM: active, suspended, deleted)

vehicle
  • vehicle_id --> PK, NOT NULL 
  • license_plate --> NOT NULL, UNIQUE
  • plate_state --> NOT NULL, UNIQUE
  • vehicle_type --> NOT NULL (ENUM: car, motorcycle, truck)
  • customer_id --> FK, NOT NULL 

staff
  • operator_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • name --> NOT NULL
  • role --> NOT NULL (ENUM: admin, attendant)
  • username --> NOT NULL, UNIQUE
  • password_hash --> NOT NULL

---

Parking Process

ticket
  • ticket_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • entry_timestamp --> NOT NULL
  • exit_timestamp --> NULLABLE, CHECK (exit_timestamp >= entry_timestamp)
  • entry_gate_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • exit_gate_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • spot_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • vehicle_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • status --> NOT NULL (ENUM: active, closed, lost, voided)
  • duration --> NULLABLE, CHECK (duration >= 0)
  • total_fee --> NULLABLE, CHECK (total_fee >= 0)

payment
  • payment_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • ticket_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • amount_charged --> NOT NULL, CHECK (amount_charged >=0)
  • payment_method --> NOT NULL (ENUM: cash, card, mobile)
  • payment_timestamp --> NOT NULL
  • payment_status --> NOT NULL (ENUM: paid, pending, failed, refunded)

reservation
  • reservation_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • customer_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • vehicle_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • start_datetime --> NOT NULL
  • end_datetime --> NOT NULL, CHECK (end_datetime > start_datetime)
  • status --> NOT NULL (ENUM: confirmed, cancelled, fulfilled, expired)
  • create_at --> NOT NULL 
  • quoted_fee --> NOT NULL, CHECK (quoted_fee >= 0)

---

System Analytics

occupancy_log
  • log_id --> PK, NOT NULL
  • spot_id --> FK, NOT NULL
  • changed_at --> NOT NULL 
  • changed_type --> NOT NULL (ENUM: occupied, freed)

system_event
  • event_id --> PK, NOT NULL 
  • source --> NOT NULL 
  • description --> NOT NULL

